      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Persistence, validation and review\nPython owns originals, OCR/Gemini extraction, validation, duplicate candidates and pending tasks. Capture nodes carry the CURRENT item context through the loop; unsupported/invalid attachments cannot inherit an earlier result. Cache condition matches the current Gemini configuration. Uncached requests wait 65 seconds; the backend enforces its own rate limit.",
